Your feet start to continuously produce carrion worms that are constantly crushed as you walk, passively increasing movement speed by [8%, 17%, 25%, 33%, 40% (TL1-5)].

You can also activate this talent to instantly destroy more worms, letting you jump in range [5, 6, 7, 8, 10 (TL1-5)] to visible terrain.

Upon landing you crush more worms, creating a radius 2 cone of gore; any creatures caught inside deals 70% less damage for one turn.

If at least 1 enemy is effected by the cone you gain an additional 20 insanity.
